  "id": "binocular-vision",
  "term": "binocular vision",
  "definition": "Binocular vision is normal seeing with both eyes acting together as a single visual system. In psychology it has been studied especially for what it shows about how visual space is perceived, including the relation between the two retinas, convergence, depth, and related visual effects.",
